# Git LFS support for model weights (see docs/weights.md).
#
# weights/rf_detr_marker.pth (~134 MB) IS committed via Git LFS -- it's
# mandatory for both segmentation paths, and Hugging Face auto-fetch isn't
# configured yet (_HF_REPO_ID in src/mats/weights.py), so committing it is the
# only working out-of-the-box path today. Once the HF repo is live, this can
# move to auto-fetch-only.
#
# weights/birefnet_leaf.pth (~2.65 GB) is NOT committed -- it's optional, and
# committing it would force every `git clone` to download 2.65 GB and spend
# the repo's LFS bandwidth quota. Fetch it explicitly with
# `mats fetch-weights --only birefnet` (or `--all`) when you need
# --mask-method birefnet.
weights/*.pth filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
